{"content":"```text\nMGX is now rebranded to Atoms. It was once MetaGPTX, built on MetaGPT and pioneers multi-agent natural language programming. It simulates software development by breaking complex tasks into stages, and supports various LLMs and revolutionizes code generation through natural language.\n```","content_sha256":"e74e859e8683f86b053fe4071f62defa96aac337e94be1b586c23469d10dc2b0","kind":"code_block","locator":"raw-official-help-snapshot.md:L38-L40","ordinal":10,"source_id":"S005","unit_id":"S005-U0010","visual":false}
