{"content":"```text\nWhat can I build with Atoms?\nYou can build websites, landing pages, portfolios, web apps, dashboards, calculators, reports, and business tools with AI-assisted building.\n\nDo I need coding experience to use Atoms?\nNo. Describe what you need and share feedback with AI agents; they help plan, build, edit, and improve the project.\n\nHow do Atoms agents help with my project?\nAtoms agents can break down tasks, analyze requirements, write code, manage data, research information, and help turn an idea into a working product.\n\nHow do I publish or share my project?\nUse Publish to create a stable public link or connect a custom domain. Use Share to export files, manage permissions, or copy a shareable link.\n```","content_sha256":"b6f210edc67f496b732c403b0f2239a942b3ea88aef91dbab87d43443cee25af","kind":"code_block","locator":"raw-official-help-snapshot.md:L44-L56","ordinal":12,"source_id":"S005","unit_id":"S005-U0012","visual":false}
